## Original Content
China's top political advisor Wang Huning on Monday urged members of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference (CPPCC) to contribute ideas and efforts to advance the modernization of agriculture and rural areas and urban development.

## Summary
China's top political advisor Wang Huning urged members of the CPPCC to contribute ideas and efforts to advance China's modernization. He specifically highlighted the modernization of agriculture, rural areas, and urban development as key areas for focus.

## Key Points
- Wang Huning calls on CPPCC members to support China's modernization efforts.
- Modernization priorities include agriculture and rural regions.
- Urban development is another critical area for advancement.


